WEBVTT

00:00:00.993 --> 00:00:10.193
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:11.003 --> 00:00:21.203
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:25.783 --> 00:00:30.683
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.193 --> 00:00:37.153
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:37.263 --> 00:00:39.193
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:39.533 --> 00:00:43.483
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:45.233 --> 00:00:48.363
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:48.773 --> 00:00:52.573
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:54.243 --> 00:01:00.243
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:02.583 --> 00:01:08.923
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:09.793 --> 00:01:15.923
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:21.403
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:21.503 --> 00:01:24.563
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:35.013 --> 00:01:39.473
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:40.023 --> 00:01:44.053
The three were summoned by Princess
Emeraude to become Magic Knights...

00:01:44.163 --> 00:01:46.923
...and save another
world called Cephiro.

00:01:48.363 --> 00:01:52.923
They have been attacked by
monsters and battled a sorceress.

00:01:54.873 --> 00:01:57.203
Water...

00:01:57.703 --> 00:01:58.673
...Dragon!

00:01:59.513 --> 00:02:03.173
Hikaru and company gained
magic from their strong feelings...

00:02:03.283 --> 00:02:06.983
...for one another,
and defeated their enemy.

00:02:06.983 --> 00:02:10.013
They are headed toward
the Spring of Eterna...

00:02:10.123 --> 00:02:13.143
...in search of the ore called escudo.

00:02:14.123 --> 00:02:20.083
Escudo, the Legendary Ore

00:02:21.733 --> 00:02:25.033
Lord Zagato,
please give me one more chance.

00:02:26.203 --> 00:02:28.533
This time,
I will get the Magic Knights...

00:02:29.173 --> 00:02:34.473
Alcyone, you have already
betrayed my trust twice.

00:02:39.183 --> 00:02:40.613
Lord Zagato.

00:02:40.853 --> 00:02:44.283
It seems the Magic Knights
are at the Spring of Eterna.

00:02:44.383 --> 00:02:46.283
So they're after escudo...

00:02:46.393 --> 00:02:47.413
Yes.

00:02:47.523 --> 00:02:50.253
Lord Zagato, I have a plan.

00:02:51.063 --> 00:02:52.853
I'm sure it will work.

00:02:52.963 --> 00:02:55.393
There are
no falsehoods in your words?

00:02:56.133 --> 00:02:59.123
I swear on my devotion
to you, Lord Zagato.

00:03:00.103 --> 00:03:02.163
I will remember that.

00:03:10.583 --> 00:03:11.913
Those brats...

00:03:12.013 --> 00:03:15.613
I will make sure you feel
the pain that I feel now.

00:03:22.623 --> 00:03:23.613
Wow!

00:03:24.393 --> 00:03:25.763
How pretty!

00:03:26.233 --> 00:03:28.093
It is like looking at a painting.

00:03:28.193 --> 00:03:29.533
Maybe this is...

00:03:29.633 --> 00:03:32.363
This has to be
the legendary Spring of Eterna!

00:03:32.473 --> 00:03:34.463
Yeah! We did it! Yippee!

00:03:36.843 --> 00:03:37.893
M-Mokona...

00:03:38.003 --> 00:03:43.173
Such odd behavior. Perhaps this is
not the legendary Spring of Eterna.

00:03:45.183 --> 00:03:48.913
That can't be! We've been
traveling this way a long time!

00:03:49.023 --> 00:03:50.413
But Mokona...

00:03:50.523 --> 00:03:53.113
Oh, there is a boat over there...

00:03:56.393 --> 00:03:57.523
Lucky!

00:03:59.733 --> 00:04:02.723
We'll know for sure
if we investigate! Come on, hurry!

00:04:02.833 --> 00:04:05.463
I feel things are going too smoothly...

00:04:09.173 --> 00:04:12.703
Stroke! Stroke! Stroke!

00:04:13.013 --> 00:04:15.503
Stroke! Stroke!

00:04:16.613 --> 00:04:17.943
Nothing is here.

00:04:18.113 --> 00:04:19.303
No way!

00:04:19.413 --> 00:04:23.183
Maybe this isn't the legendary
Spring of Eterna after all...

00:04:33.193 --> 00:04:34.323
Ow...

00:04:50.643 --> 00:04:52.613
What is this thing?

00:05:05.123 --> 00:05:08.823
That spring was
Mr. Monster's trap after all.

00:05:09.303 --> 00:05:12.793
What a letdown! A spring-shaped
monster is against the rules!

00:05:15.133 --> 00:05:17.193
I hate cheaters like that!

00:05:17.943 --> 00:05:19.673
Water...

00:05:25.443 --> 00:05:26.713
...Dragon!

00:05:33.923 --> 00:05:35.683
Umi, you did it!

00:05:36.823 --> 00:05:38.353
Hikaru, you okay?

00:05:38.463 --> 00:05:39.453
Yeah!

00:05:39.563 --> 00:05:42.763
Anyway, I feel we are all like ghosts.

00:05:44.433 --> 00:05:46.863
I'm sure it'll go away once we're dry.

00:05:48.503 --> 00:05:49.563
Mokona...

00:05:50.773 --> 00:05:53.713
The legendary Spring
of Eterna is over there?

00:06:07.623 --> 00:06:08.593
Here?

00:06:09.893 --> 00:06:12.623
This is the legendary
Spring of Eterna?

00:06:12.733 --> 00:06:14.323
You're kidding...

00:06:18.403 --> 00:06:21.463
Wait a minute!
Where do you see a spring?

00:06:22.003 --> 00:06:24.163
There is nothing here
that resembles water.

00:06:24.543 --> 00:06:26.303
H-Hey, over there...

00:06:26.643 --> 00:06:28.403
What's that line up there?

00:06:29.483 --> 00:06:30.443
Line?

00:06:37.383 --> 00:06:39.013
It is a line.

00:06:40.093 --> 00:06:41.953
What does that mean?

00:06:42.923 --> 00:06:45.913
I do not know. This line is just here.

00:06:47.593 --> 00:06:49.893
Oh, Mokona, where are you...

00:06:51.063 --> 00:06:54.123
Why is there a line
drawn here of all places?

00:06:54.203 --> 00:06:57.003
Who knows?
Cephiro is a strange place...

00:06:58.943 --> 00:07:01.033
Fuu! Umi! Come up here!

00:07:07.383 --> 00:07:09.413
A-A spring?

00:07:11.323 --> 00:07:13.813
This is the legendary
Spring of Eterna?

00:07:13.923 --> 00:07:16.953
But there wasn't
anything there a moment ago!

00:07:24.303 --> 00:07:25.563
It's that line!

00:07:25.663 --> 00:07:29.073
This spring looks like a line
unless you look at it from above!

00:07:29.173 --> 00:07:30.263
I see.

00:07:30.743 --> 00:07:33.203
Two-dimensional. In other words...

00:07:33.313 --> 00:07:35.333
...this is a flat spring.

00:07:36.683 --> 00:07:40.173
So? Where in this completely flat,
weird Spring of Eterna...

00:07:40.283 --> 00:07:43.043
...do we find
the legendary ore escudo?

00:07:47.593 --> 00:07:48.713
Mokona!

00:07:48.853 --> 00:07:51.693
It seems that the escudo
is inside this spring.

00:07:52.163 --> 00:07:56.723
But we don't know how deep it is.
And how will we breathe underwater?

00:07:58.963 --> 00:08:00.063
Who knows?

00:08:01.733 --> 00:08:04.703
We will not know until we go in.

00:08:04.803 --> 00:08:07.743
This trip is just
one disaster after another.

00:08:07.843 --> 00:08:09.173
I'm going in.

00:08:09.283 --> 00:08:10.173
Hikaru...

00:08:10.243 --> 00:08:14.543
I think Mokona just told us
that the legendary ore escudo...

00:08:14.653 --> 00:08:16.583
...is inside this spring.

00:08:17.223 --> 00:08:19.483
I'm determined
to become a Magic Knight.

00:08:20.023 --> 00:08:21.923
So I have to get some escudo.

00:08:22.223 --> 00:08:23.213
You're right.

00:08:23.863 --> 00:08:27.453
Let's go. Nothing will
happen if we sit around here.

00:08:28.363 --> 00:08:30.453
I don't know what will happen...

00:08:30.563 --> 00:08:34.623
...but I think what we can't
do alone, we can do together.

00:08:36.843 --> 00:08:38.273
Ready, set...

00:08:39.113 --> 00:08:39.973
...go!

00:08:53.753 --> 00:08:55.913
Everything is as planned.

00:08:56.823 --> 00:08:58.293
Magic Knights...

00:08:59.733 --> 00:09:02.223
This will be your graves.

00:09:06.303 --> 00:09:07.323
Fuu...

00:09:08.333 --> 00:09:09.273
Umi...

00:09:23.383 --> 00:09:25.083
Umi! Fuu!

00:09:43.443 --> 00:09:44.773
It can't be...

00:09:46.943 --> 00:09:47.873
Hikari.

00:09:48.613 --> 00:09:50.133
Why are you here?

00:09:50.743 --> 00:09:51.713
Hikaru!

00:09:52.283 --> 00:09:53.253
Fuu!

00:09:54.883 --> 00:09:56.313
Where are you?

00:10:01.853 --> 00:10:03.913
I guess we got separated...

00:10:12.363 --> 00:10:14.463
Dad? Mom?

00:10:18.803 --> 00:10:21.603
I wonder if this is inside that spring.

00:10:32.083 --> 00:10:33.053
Myself?

00:10:44.633 --> 00:10:48.503
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:10:52.173 --> 00:10:54.473
Hikari... It's you, right?

00:10:55.873 --> 00:10:57.433
Why are you here?

00:11:00.913 --> 00:11:01.883
Hikari!

00:11:03.483 --> 00:11:04.953
What's wrong, Hikari?

00:11:19.373 --> 00:11:20.633
Hikari...

00:11:20.733 --> 00:11:21.833
It's me!

00:11:23.403 --> 00:11:24.733
It's Hikaru!

00:11:25.143 --> 00:11:26.903
Don't you hear me?

00:11:30.643 --> 00:11:31.943
Hikari...

00:11:35.753 --> 00:11:38.183
Dad, Mom, why?

00:11:38.853 --> 00:11:40.613
Why are you here?

00:11:40.723 --> 00:11:42.713
Or is this a dream?

00:11:50.433 --> 00:11:52.903
This pain... isn't a dream!

00:12:00.373 --> 00:12:02.843
This... is not a mirror.

00:12:11.683 --> 00:12:15.093
This is a series of disasters,
just as Ms. Umi said.

00:12:21.693 --> 00:12:24.133
She was the one who was hit...

00:12:24.433 --> 00:12:25.453
Why?

00:12:33.513 --> 00:12:35.443
If I get hurt...

00:12:35.543 --> 00:12:37.513
...she also gets hurt.

00:12:39.283 --> 00:12:41.113
If she gets hurt...

00:12:41.213 --> 00:12:43.153
...I also get hurt.

00:12:43.453 --> 00:12:44.613
That means...

00:12:45.283 --> 00:12:46.553
She is...

00:12:47.553 --> 00:12:48.583
...me?

00:12:54.893 --> 00:12:57.093
Stop it, Hikari! Why?

00:12:57.903 --> 00:13:00.833
We've always been
together since we were little.

00:13:01.103 --> 00:13:04.933
You were always with me when
I was happy or when I was sad.

00:13:05.043 --> 00:13:08.603
I always told you that I loved you!

00:13:08.713 --> 00:13:09.973
But now...

00:13:10.413 --> 00:13:11.383
Why?

00:13:16.553 --> 00:13:17.853
Hikari...

00:13:17.953 --> 00:13:21.353
Don't you... like me anymore?

00:13:23.193 --> 00:13:25.323
Dad, Mom, stop!

00:13:28.433 --> 00:13:30.163
What can I do?

00:13:30.263 --> 00:13:32.703
I can't attack Dad or Mom!

00:13:33.933 --> 00:13:36.963
To think that I would attack myself...

00:13:37.573 --> 00:13:40.733
Attacking
the opponent damages me...

00:13:41.543 --> 00:13:43.273
What should I do?

00:13:43.383 --> 00:13:47.613
And she seems to be
more confident than I am...

00:13:49.113 --> 00:13:50.553
Magic Knights...

00:13:51.123 --> 00:13:51.983
What?

00:13:52.053 --> 00:13:52.913
Who?

00:13:52.993 --> 00:13:54.453
Who was that?

00:13:54.553 --> 00:13:56.453
Girls from another world...

00:13:56.563 --> 00:13:59.993
That voice... is the one
we heard at Tokyo Tower...

00:14:00.363 --> 00:14:03.453
Does that mean you're
the one who summoned us?

00:14:04.833 --> 00:14:06.393
Princess Emeraude?

00:14:07.003 --> 00:14:09.763
I am Emeraude of Cephiro.

00:14:10.143 --> 00:14:14.373
Magic Knights, do not
let sorrow rule your hearts.

00:14:14.873 --> 00:14:17.673
Princess Emeraude!
How are you here?

00:14:18.213 --> 00:14:21.983
Girls from another world,
hold your hearts strong...

00:14:22.213 --> 00:14:23.313
...and think.

00:14:24.053 --> 00:14:26.243
Are those who are before you...

00:14:27.053 --> 00:14:29.923
...those whom you hold dear?

00:14:30.323 --> 00:14:32.053
He's a dear friend!

00:14:32.163 --> 00:14:35.063
He always stayed
by my side when I cried.

00:14:35.593 --> 00:14:38.033
He worried about me when I tripped.

00:14:38.133 --> 00:14:42.533
He can't speak human words, but we
can understand each other's hearts.

00:14:42.633 --> 00:14:44.403
He's a dear friend!

00:14:44.503 --> 00:14:46.063
They're my dear parents.

00:14:46.173 --> 00:14:51.543
I remember all the love
my parents gave me as I grew up.

00:14:51.643 --> 00:14:55.983
I saved it in my heart and plan to
return it bit by bit when I'm an adult.

00:14:56.083 --> 00:15:01.283
I haven't returned any of it yet!
Of course I can't fight Dad and Mom!

00:15:01.393 --> 00:15:03.853
I hold myself dear.

00:15:03.963 --> 00:15:05.823
If something happened to me...

00:15:05.923 --> 00:15:08.263
My father, my mother, my sister...

00:15:08.363 --> 00:15:11.353
Everyone
who loves me would suffer!

00:15:11.463 --> 00:15:15.803
I am still a child and cannot do
anything for those that love me.

00:15:15.903 --> 00:15:19.463
So I want to at least show
them that I am living happily...

00:15:19.573 --> 00:15:22.103
...because that is all I can do.

00:15:22.213 --> 00:15:24.613
That is why I hold myself dear!

00:15:24.943 --> 00:15:26.503
Then think.

00:15:26.613 --> 00:15:31.053
Would those you hold dear
injure you in any way?

00:15:31.653 --> 00:15:35.423
Would they wish you
to be hurt or to feel pain?

00:15:35.623 --> 00:15:37.153
Think carefully...

00:15:37.263 --> 00:15:40.233
...and find the legendary ore escudo.

00:15:47.373 --> 00:15:48.333
No.

00:15:49.103 --> 00:15:51.433
Hikari would never
do something like this.

00:15:51.543 --> 00:15:55.003
Hikari was always
kind and protected me.

00:15:55.743 --> 00:15:58.113
This isn't Hikari!

00:15:58.613 --> 00:16:02.173
That's right!
Dad and Mom wouldn't hurt me!

00:16:02.283 --> 00:16:05.813
I will heal these wounds
with my cure spell later!

00:16:09.963 --> 00:16:12.793
I can't believe you
attacked me posing as Hikari!

00:16:15.933 --> 00:16:18.453
Don't try to stir
things up in a happy family!

00:16:21.733 --> 00:16:24.633
If something happened to me,
my family would be worried!

00:16:28.243 --> 00:16:30.543
Ruby Lightning!

00:16:34.953 --> 00:16:36.923
Sapphire Whirlwind!

00:16:43.193 --> 00:16:44.883
Emerald Typhoon!

00:16:59.973 --> 00:17:00.903
Umi...

00:17:01.573 --> 00:17:02.633
Fuu...

00:17:03.443 --> 00:17:04.573
Ms. Hikaru...

00:17:05.243 --> 00:17:07.013
We were this close?

00:17:07.113 --> 00:17:08.913
Then what were we...

00:17:09.013 --> 00:17:11.543
I am sure that
we were being tested...

00:17:12.253 --> 00:17:15.483
...on whether we have
hearts worthy of Magic Knights.

00:17:15.593 --> 00:17:17.853
Then could this be...

00:17:18.663 --> 00:17:21.253
The legendary ore escudo.

00:17:21.363 --> 00:17:23.453
I was waiting for this moment!

00:17:24.833 --> 00:17:29.273
Escudo can be handled only by
those that complete Eterna's trials.

00:17:29.373 --> 00:17:32.743
Nothing less from Magic Knights
summoned by Princess Emeraude.

00:17:32.843 --> 00:17:34.433
But this is the end!

00:17:34.543 --> 00:17:36.943
Are you trying to steal
the escudo from us?

00:17:37.043 --> 00:17:40.813
Yes. Defeat the Magic Knights
and obtain some escudo.

00:17:40.913 --> 00:17:43.383
It kills two birds with one stone.

00:17:43.623 --> 00:17:45.383
I won't let you!

00:17:53.963 --> 00:17:57.523
It looks like that water
monster's poison is taking effect.

00:17:57.633 --> 00:17:58.963
What was that?

00:17:59.063 --> 00:18:00.553
That water monster's poison...

00:18:01.233 --> 00:18:03.433
That glow we saw earlier...

00:18:03.543 --> 00:18:07.113
Yes. This poison doesn't
have immediate results.

00:18:07.113 --> 00:18:10.473
I timed it to give me
the desired results...

00:18:10.583 --> 00:18:13.843
...right around when
you would find the escudo.

00:18:13.953 --> 00:18:15.213
Damn it...

00:18:17.053 --> 00:18:19.753
And now you shall die full of regret.

00:18:19.853 --> 00:18:21.443
Frozen Finale!

00:18:23.493 --> 00:18:25.463
I win this battle.

00:18:26.093 --> 00:18:29.323
So give up now
so you can rest in peace!

00:18:30.333 --> 00:18:32.663
We can't give up.

00:18:33.303 --> 00:18:36.633
That's right.
We promised Ms. Presea!

00:18:37.343 --> 00:18:40.103
That we would return with escudo!

00:18:41.743 --> 00:18:44.003
We'll never, ever...

00:18:44.483 --> 00:18:45.473
...give up!

00:18:49.783 --> 00:18:50.843
What?

00:18:54.293 --> 00:18:55.453
This is...

00:18:55.893 --> 00:18:56.983
The escudo...

00:18:57.593 --> 00:19:00.523
...is getting absorbed
into the hand ornament?

00:19:17.143 --> 00:19:19.303
The armor Clef gave us changed!

00:19:19.813 --> 00:19:22.013
It looks better than before!

00:19:22.113 --> 00:19:24.283
This armor evolves.

00:19:24.883 --> 00:19:26.013
You little...

00:19:26.123 --> 00:19:27.713
Icicle Onslaught!

00:19:28.053 --> 00:19:29.753
Umi! Fuu!

00:19:29.863 --> 00:19:30.823
Right!

00:19:31.663 --> 00:19:33.183
Emerald Typhoon!

00:19:35.663 --> 00:19:38.193
Sapphire Whirlwind!

00:19:45.003 --> 00:19:47.563
Ruby Lightning!

00:19:57.483 --> 00:19:58.883
We did it!

00:20:13.873 --> 00:20:15.063
This is...

00:20:16.943 --> 00:20:17.903
Mokona!

00:20:27.283 --> 00:20:29.583
We got the escudo.

00:20:30.953 --> 00:20:34.543
Now we can make the weapons
to become Magic Knights.

00:20:35.953 --> 00:20:37.923
We should hurry back.

00:20:38.023 --> 00:20:41.653
Ms. Presea is waiting for us
in the Forest of Silence.

00:20:52.973 --> 00:20:54.403
Lord Zagato...

00:20:55.073 --> 00:20:56.773
I beg your forgiveness!

00:20:56.883 --> 00:21:00.373
To think that the Magic Knights
had grown that much...

00:21:00.753 --> 00:21:03.913
However, if I can be
given one more chance...

00:21:04.023 --> 00:21:06.313
This time for sure, Lord Zagato!

00:21:06.993 --> 00:21:08.783
Stand back, Alcyone.

00:21:09.893 --> 00:21:11.153
Pathetic.

00:21:11.793 --> 00:21:14.663
Magic can't be used
in the Forest of Silence.

00:21:14.763 --> 00:21:17.253
It's the same
no matter who goes. So...

00:21:17.363 --> 00:21:20.303
...allow me, the one who knows
the most about the Magic Knights.

00:21:21.073 --> 00:21:24.063
The Forest of Silence's
seal has been broken.

00:21:24.173 --> 00:21:27.303
It is now like other forests
where magic can be used.

00:21:27.413 --> 00:21:30.703
Then all the more reason
to use me, a sorceress...

00:21:32.583 --> 00:21:33.983
Lord Zagato!

00:21:34.083 --> 00:21:35.943
My dear Lord Zagato!

00:21:37.053 --> 00:21:38.023
Begone.

00:21:39.083 --> 00:21:40.073
No!

00:21:40.693 --> 00:21:43.153
Save me, Lord Zagato! Save me!

00:21:45.423 --> 00:21:47.393
Lord Zagato!

00:21:48.563 --> 00:21:50.293
The Magic Knights...

00:21:50.403 --> 00:21:52.863
It seems we took them too lightly.

00:21:52.963 --> 00:21:57.663
So will the Magic Knights fight
to save Cephiro like in the legends?

00:21:57.773 --> 00:21:59.763
But still, she's pathetic.

00:21:59.873 --> 00:22:02.203
To lose to kids like that.

00:22:03.213 --> 00:22:07.273
Hey, Zagato, let me go.
I wanna play with those girls.

00:22:08.183 --> 00:22:10.653
Very well, Ascot.

00:22:13.553 --> 00:22:15.523
I'll be on my way.

00:22:25.733 --> 00:22:30.133
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:31.703 --> 00:22:37.303
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:38.743 --> 00:22:44.313
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:45.023 --> 00:22:48.883
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:51.193 --> 00:22:54.353
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:54.563 --> 00:22:56.993
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:58.103 --> 00:23:01.903
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:02.933 --> 00:23:09.573
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:10.313 --> 00:23:15.583
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:15.953 --> 00:23:22.753
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:23.253 --> 00:23:28.693
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:43.713 --> 00:23:45.613
I'm Hikaru Shidou.

00:23:45.983 --> 00:23:48.913
We returned with
the legendary ore escudo...

00:23:49.013 --> 00:23:52.313
...and now we have
Presea making us our weapons.

00:23:52.423 --> 00:23:56.793
But there, Summoner Ascot,
who was under Zagato's orders...

00:23:56.893 --> 00:23:59.653
...attacked us
with his creature Atalante.

00:23:59.763 --> 00:24:03.093
And what's worse,
magic doesn't work on Atalante!

00:24:03.663 --> 00:24:05.633
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:05.903 --> 00:24:07.333
Lives at Stake - Presea's Weapons.

00:24:07.333 --> 00:24:09.103
Lives at Stake - Presea's Weapons
Lives at Stake - Presea's Weapons.

00:24:09.103 --> 00:24:11.343
Lives at Stake - Presea's Weapons
You have to watch it!

00:24:11.343 --> 00:24:18.273
Who is it today?

00:24:19.343 --> 00:24:21.243
Today, it's Mokona!

00:24:21.353 --> 00:24:26.313
Look forward to the next episode!
